```console
$ scherzo-cloud github setup begin --help
Begin browser-based GitHub setup

Usage: scherzo-cloud github setup begin [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --json                 Print the GitHub result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
